ke “Leg press 3x12 40 kg”.":"Liftr nenašiel žiadne cviky. Použi riadky ako „Leg press 3x12 40 kg“.","Liftr export":"Export z Liftru","Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.":"Liftr nemá účet, server ani reklamy. Tvoje tréningy, cviky, plány, telesné miery a permanentka sú uložené v tvojom zariadení a v tvojom vlastnom súkromnom iCloude.","Liftr is built to keep your training private.":"Liftr je vytvorený tak, aby tvoje tréningy zostali súkromné.","Liftr saves workouts with duration and calories and reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate. Change access in the Health app → Profile → Apps → Liftr.":"Liftr ukladá tréningy s dĺžkou a kalóriami a číta tvoju hmotnosť, zloženie tela a pokojový tep. Prístup zmeníš v aplikácii Zdravie → Profil → Aplikácie → Liftr.","Liftr shows what you did last time, your records and how much stronger you're getting.":"Liftr ukazuje tvoj minulý tréning, rekordy a o koľko silnieš.","Liftr tries again automatically.":"Liftr to automaticky skúsi znova.","Liftr tries again later. Your workouts are safe on this device.":"Liftr to skúsi znova neskôr. Tvoje tréningy sú v tomto zariadení v bezpečí.","Log weight":"Zapísať hmotnosť","Log your exercises, sets, reps and weight in seconds — no more notes.":"Zapisuj cviky, série, opakovania a váhu za pár sekúnd — žiadne ďalšie poznámky.","MIN":"MIN","Machine":"Stroj","Make a routine":"Vytvor plán","Mark set done":"Označiť sériu ako hotovú","Max":"Max","Min":"Min","Minimise":"Minimalizovať","Morning workout":"Ranný tréning","Most reps":"Najviac opak.","Muscle group":"Svalová partia","My routines":"Moje plány","Name":"Názov","Name of the gym":"Názov posilňovne","Name on the pass (optional)":"Meno na permanentke (voliteľné)","Name, e.g. Monday: legs":"Názov, napr. Pondelok: nohy","New":"Nový","New exercise":"Nový cvik","New records":"Nové rekordy","New 